commit d82387e4cd8bbbdf431789851e67c05ff8e96b95

C03: words that only repeat are an unresolved input; the turn says so and asks what the person needs (CONVERSATION1585)

CONVERSATION1150 measured H0410 «Artiro, artiro. Estimado, estimado.» as a knowledge conversation that pretended to understand («el clásico “artiro, artiro”»). `_echoed_words` names the input kind `echoed_words` when every word arrives at least twice and nothing else does (four to twelve words, at most four distinct, no digits or question marks, no assent, negation or greeting words, no request head); `clarify_unresolved_input` composes one short question that says only repeated words arrived without a request and asks what the person needs, and rejects a question that repeats those words, attributes them a meaning or asks nothing (one corrected retry). Screened over the whole private registry: only H0410 takes the new kind.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


